ont:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-17">Создание лендингов</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-18">Корпоративный сайт на ИИ-платформе</a></div></details><details data-mgrp="" open="" style="margin:0"><summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px;font:var(--type-h5);font-stretch:25%;text-transform:uppercase;list-style:none;cursor:pointer">Репутация и геосервисы<span data-mplus="" style="font:400 22px/1 Onest,sans-serif;transition:transform .3s">+</span></summary><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-19">Управление репутацией</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-20">Геомаркетинг</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-21">Ведение и оформление Яндекс Бизнес</a></div></details><details data-mgrp="" open="" style="margin:0"><summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px;font:var(--type-h5);font-stretch:25%;text-transform:uppercase;list-style:none;cursor:pointer">Стратегия и поддержка<span data-mplus="" style="font:400 22px/1 Onest,sans-serif;transition:transform .3s">+</span></summary><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-22">Стратегия Digital-маркетинга</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-body-small);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-23">Техническая поддержка</a></div></details></div></div><div data-mc="" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start"><details style="width:100%"><summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font:var(--type-nav-title);font-stretch:25%;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0F0F0F;transition:color .25s" class="export-hover-24">Цены<span style="font:400 22px/1 Onest,sans-serif;transition:transform .3s">+</span></summary><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:14px 0 2px"><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-ui-copy);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-25">SEO-продвижение ↗</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-ui-copy);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-26">Контекстная реклама ↗</a><a href="#" style="font:var(--type-ui-copy);color:rgba(15,15,15,.62);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-27">Разработка сайтов ↗</a></div></details><a href="#" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:var(--type-nav-title);font-stretch:25%;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0F0F0F;transition:color .25s" class="export-hover-28">О компании <span style="font:400 20px/1 Onest,sans-serif">↗</span></a><a href="#" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:var(--type-nav-title);font-stretch:25%;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0F0F0F;transition:color .25s" class="export-hover-29">Блог <span style="font:400 20px/1 Onest,sans-serif">↗</span></a><div data-mcontacts="" style="display:contents"><a href={contactDetails.email.href} style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font:var(--type-h5);font-stretch:var(--display-stretch);color:#0F0F0F;transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-30">ork@prosto-r.ru <span data-marrow="" style="font:400 13px/1 Onest,sans-serif">↗</span></a><a data-mphone="" href={contactDetails.phone.href} style="display:none;font:var(--type-h5);font-stretch:var(--display-stretch);color:#0F0F0F">{contactDetails.phone.label}</a></div><div data-msoc="" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;margin-top:12px"><a href={contactDetails.telegram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:var(--type-label);color:rgba(15,15,15,.75);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-31"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex:none"><path d="M3 10.5 20 4l-3.5 16-5-5-3 3 .5-6 8-5-10 4.5Z"></path></svg>Telegram</a><a href="https://wa.me/79118270369" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:var(--type-label);color:rgba(15,15,15,.75);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-32"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex:none"><path d="M5 18 3 21l4-1a9 9 0 1 0-2-2Z"></path><path d="m8 7 2 3-1 1c1 2 2 3 4 3l1-1 3 1c-1 4-6 3-9 0S5 8 8 7Z"></path></svg>WhatsApp</a><a href="https://vk.com/prostor_24" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:var(--type-label);color:rgba(15,15,15,.75);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-33"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex:none"><path d="M3 7h3c0 4 2 6 3 7V7h3v4c2-1 3-3 4-4h4l-4 6c3 2 4 4 4 4h-4l-4-4v4H9C5 16 3 12 3 7Z"></path></svg>ВКонтакте</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ProstorDigitalAgency/videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:var(--type-label);color:rgba(15,15,15,.75);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-34"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex:none"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"></rect><path d="m10 9 6 3-6 3Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>YouTube</a><a href="https://dzen.ru/prostor_digital_agency" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:var(--type-label);color:rgba(15,15,15,.75);transition:color .2s" class="export-hover-35"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="width:15px;height:15px;flex:none"><path d="M12 2c0 8 2 10 10 10-8 0-10 2-10 10 0-8-2-10-10-10C10 12 12 10 12 2Z"></path></svg>Дзен</a></div><a href="#" data-mcta="" style="display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;background:#FA001E;color:#E9EBEF;padding:20px 24px;font:var(--type-button);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase">Обсудить задачу <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div>

